SUMMARY:Healing with Nature
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Lets form a circle and bring in Earth M
 other\, spirit Mother of the earth\, and the Grand Council of Grandmothers
 . We’ll also call in nature spirits to work with us. Nature is available
  to work with anyone and everyone including our animals\, homes\, and love
 d ones – on any issue\; jobs\, transitions\, physical issues... This is 
 a non-religious circle\, people of any or no religion are all welcome.**\n
 **The Earth Mother\, and Nature\, are deeply aware of us as human beings\,
  and as individuals. She/they are here to support us\, and worth with us o
 n any aspect of our lives. They can help us ease into transitions\; call o
 n our inner beings to be a part of nature. Allow nature to support your bo
 dy\, mind\, and spirit\, by helping call your physical and emotional bodie
 s into greater harmony. The Earth mother is will support your chakra syste
 m in a very gentle and deep way.**\n**There is no prerequisite. – Just y
 ou\, me\, and Nature working energetically as a group. There will be time 
 for individual work as well as group work. --- Bring a specific request if
  you have it. Or just bring yourself if nothing special comes to mind!**\n
 **We will be practicing Angel Essence Energy medicine. Angel Essence is a 
 very gentle hands off healing modality. Angel Essence energy healing bring
 s light info life from within. Lisa has been practicing for a decade or mo
 re. She works with individuals\, both human and animals. She loves working
  with groups as well.**\n**RSVP – Lisa at 865 254 7045**\n**Fee – Sugg
 ested Fee $25\, donation based**
