 r insigt into what the stars have been trying to tell you.\n✩ 🪐Summer
  Astrology Reading Pop Up ✩ 🪐\nCome see us at the vibey Daytrip Sunda
 ys 4pm-8pm all July\nLearn about your soul's blueprint and/or how the curr
 ent sky is influencing you.\n\\~First come first serve\, sign up station w
 ill be set up\\~\nPop ups are the only way to access our 10 for 10 special
  ✩\n\n* **30 min Mini Chart or Transit Reading $55**\n* **10 min for $10
  Intuitive Musings**\n* **75 min Full Chart Reading $111**\n\n**-Visual Re
 ferences Emailed-**\n**-Recording Welcome-**
